    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsango kūlwa shibi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Munhū ose ose ū mu Baisilseli ūlū ūmfunya ng'wana wakwe kūbiza shitambò kūlī Moleki, ū ng'wenūyo shiigelila abūlagwe, ni abizage ng'wana byalwa, nūūlū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga mu sī ying'we. A banhū ba ng'wigūngūli lyakwe hū bene bakūmūlaga bo kūmponda mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū nene nakūbiza ng'wilwisha wakwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo, nankomanye winge gete ū mu banhū bakwe. Nguno ū wa kūfunya baana bakwe babize shitambò kūlī Moleki, akūbiza walīsosohaja ī lipandī lyane ī lyeela, na wagimaga kūkenaagūla lina lyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wigūngūli lyakwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū būmona alīmfunīja Moleki nūūlū ūmò wa baana bakwe, alīyo hū būleka ū kūndīlīla; būleka kūmūlaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nene ng'wenekīlī nakwilwisha nang'hwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo, hamò nī kaya yakwe, pye na a babo bakūsangīlaga nang'hwe ū mu wīmīlīzu wa kūnondeela Moleki; nakūbakomanya bīnge gete ū mu banhū babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nūūlū munhū ūgalūkīla mihayo ya bachūūja na ya banhū abo basanije nguzu ja masamva, wandya kūyūja akūtagaalījaga kūbalondeela banhū balī gīko, ū ng'wenūyo nag'hwe nakūbiza ng'wilwisha wakwe ū nene; nakūnkomanya wīnge ū mu banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū iyeejagi bing'we benekīlī mubize beela; nguno ū nene nalī SEEBA, Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īdimagi īyo naamuhelelaga, mushimīzīle muyo; ū nene nalī SEEBA ūyo akūng'wītaga mubize beela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū munhū wa kūndūka ise nūūlū nina, shiigeleelilwe abūlagwe; nguno wandūkaga ise nūūlū nina. A mininga gaakwe gakwidīka kūlwa nguno yakwe wei ng'wenekīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū munhū ūlaala na nkīma atoolilwe, akūbiza washihyaga na nke wa nzenganwa ng'wiye, ū ngosha nū nkīma ng'wenūyo shiigelile babūlagwe būbīlī wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nūūlū munhū ūlaala na nke o ng'wa ise, akūbiza wang'wibengelejaga ū ise; ū ngosha ng'wenūyo nū nkīma shiigelile babūlagwe būbīlī wabo. A mininga gabo gakwidīka kūlwa nguno yabo boi benekīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nū wa kūlaala na ng'wīnga wakwe, nang'hwe shiigelile abūlagwe; a bose būbīlī wabo shiigelile babūlagwe, nguno bīītaga mhayo gwa soso nhaale no. A mininga gabo gakwidīka kūlwa nguno yabo boi benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha ūlū ūlaala na ngosha ng'wiye gītī kūlaala na nkīma; a benabo būbīlī wabo bīītaga mhayo gwa soso nhaale no. Shiigelile babūlagwe, a mininga gabo gakwidīka kūlwa nguno yabo boi benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūbatoola bakīma babīlī, munhū na nina, ū gwenūyo mhayo gwa būsoso; ū ngosha ng'wenūyo na a bakīma benabo, shiigelile babūlagwe bo kūpemva mu moto, muyīnje gete pyī ī mihayo ya būsoso ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ngosha ūlaala na shiinū, shiigelile abūlagwe; nī shiinū yeene mukwībūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū nkīma wifunya kūlaala na shiinū, shiigelile abūlagwe ū nkīma ng'wenūyo hamò nī shiinū yenīyo. A banhū ba gīko shiigelile kūbūlagwa; a mininga gabo gakwidīka kūlwa nguno yabo boi benekīlī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ngosha ūntoola ilūmbūye, nshīke o ng'wa ise nūūlū nshīke o ng'wa nina, ūmona dūūhū yakwe, nū nkīma ūmona dūūhū yakwe ū ngosha, ū mhayo gwenūyo gwa soni no. A banhū benabo īkwigeleelwa bakomanyiwe gete, bīnjiwe ū mu miso ga banhū babo. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo akūbiza wītile mhayo gwa soni ū kūl'ilūmbūye; ū būbi wakwe akūbūbūūcha wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ngosha ūlaala na nkīma alī mu shikū jakwe ja ng'weji, ūmona dūūhū yakwe; akūbiza wabonaga minala ya mininga gakwe ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, ū nkīma nang'hwe akūbiza oolechaga minala ya mininga gakwe; a bose būbīlī wabo shibigelile bakomanyiwe gete bīnjiwe ū mu banhū babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūlaala na ng'wana wa ng'wawe o ng'wa mayū wako, nūūlū n'ilūmbūye lya ng'wa so, nguno ū mhayo gwenūyo gūlī gwa magooke ū kū banhū ba mu kaya. Bose būbīlī wabo bakūbūbūūcha ū būbi wabo boi benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūlaala na nke o ng'wa ise,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nke o ng'wa ise:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Basukuma bakahayaga, nina ng'wīnga.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akūbiza wang'wibengelejaga ū ise; a bose būbīlī wabo bakūbūbūūcha ū būbi wabo, bakūcha na kūbyala yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūntoola nke wa ng'wana wa ng'wawe, ū wenūbo būsoso, wang'wītīlaga ibengwe ng'wana wa ng'wawe. Bakūcha na kūbyala yaya. Banhū abo bakatūmamīlaga nguzu ja myoyo misoso mu kūgema kūlagūla banhū bangī, nūūlū kūbawīla īyo īlabilongele kū shikū ja kū būtongi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūshilang'hana shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
