            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadimagi pye a malange gaane nī shilagīlo shaane, nīyo mushimīzīle musho gete; ītizūmuswa ī sī īyo nalīmutwala kwikala mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we yaya ū kūshimīzīla mu nhūngwa ja banhū abo nalībapeeja bang'wīngīle. Nguno a bene baayītaga pyī ī yenīyī, h'ī nguno yeene nabakolilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we nakamuwīla, “Nene ng'wenekīlī nakūng'winha ī sī yabo ng'wīdime, ībize wingīji wing'we; ī sī yenīyo ī ya būhondo ya kūsūlūlūcha būki na mabele",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sī ya būhondo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shihebulania shihayile, ‘sī ya kūsūlūlūka mabeelè na būūkī;’ kenaka kahayīle ka Bahebulania ka koolecha wiza bo sī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū nene nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we; nene h'ūyo naamukomanya kūfuma mu mahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
