            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na lūūlū īng'wigeleelilwe kūtūūla ho būlekanya a ha gatī ya ndimu ījo jibalilwe kūbiza jawiza nī jijo jitī jawiza; nī noni ī jawiza nī jitī jawiza. A bing'we yaya ū kwisosohaja mu nzīla ya shiinū yose yose, nūūlū noni yose yose; nūūlū ni mu nzīla ya shiseeng'wa shose shose īsho shikashimīzaga hasī, īsho nashihayile gīkī shilī shisoso ū kū bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiigelile mubize beela, nguno ū nene SEEBA nalī ng'wela; nene ng'wenekīlī naamukomanya kūfuma mu mahanga gīkī mubize banhū bane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
